Kata,

first off, note that you are using an older version of geomorph. The current version of procD.lm does not provide the pieces you are trying to use to plot the min and max of the allometry line, and that might cause issues in the future. So please make sure to install the most recent version of geomorph from either CRAN (you may want to wait a couple of days as a new minor release is on the way) or from github.

At present, what you are trying to do could be done using e.g. the function shape.predictor as such:

allom.shapes <- shape.predictor(coords, log(Csize), Intercept = T, method = "LS",
                                                 pred.min = min(log(Csize), pred.max = max(log(Csize))))

Then to plot:

plotRefToTarget(mshape(coords), allom.shapes$pred.min) # with any other desired plotting arguments

Hope this helps
Antigoni

